{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00053","headline":"学仙二首 · 许浑","name":"学仙二首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉武迎仙紫禁秋，玉笙瑶瑟祀昆丘。 年年望断无消息，空闭重城十二楼。 心期仙诀意无穷，采画云车起寿宫。 闻有三山未知处，茂陵松柏满西风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/curated_00053.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=curated_00053","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于与开放语料未能唯一对齐，保留为整理本异文/组诗条目","citation":"周慧珍"}